{"ref":"BDB, עַמִּיאֵל²","hw":"עַמִּיאֵל²","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">עַמִּיאֵל</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m. (</strong><em>my kinsman is God</em>, Gray<sup>Prop. N. 254</sup><strong>)</strong>;—𝔊 Αμ(με)ιηλ:<br><strong>1.</strong>  E. Jordan name <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 9:4\" href=\"/II_Samuel.9.4\">2 S 9:4</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 9:5\" href=\"/II_Samuel.9.5\">5</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 17:27\" href=\"/II_Samuel.17.27\">17:27</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  a Danite <a data-ref=\"Numbers 13:12\" href=\"/Numbers.13.12\">Nu 13:12</a> (P).<br><strong>3.</strong>  David’s father-in-law <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 3:5\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.3.5\">1 Ch 3:5</a> (= <span dir=\"rtl\">אֱלִיעָם</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 11:3\" href=\"/II_Samuel.11.3\">2 S 11:3</a>).<br><strong>4.</strong>  son of Obed Edom <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 26:5\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.26.5\">1 Ch 26:5</a>.","next":"BDB, עַמִּיהוּד","prev":"BDB, עַמּוֹנִי"}